        313.6344299316406
      ],
      "text": "automated nucleic acid amplification test; UR: uncertainty range.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        330.6426086425781,
        526.964599609375,
        343.7876281738281
      ],
      "text": "More information on the cost–effectiveness analysis of concurrent use of tests in children is",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        346.1426086425781,
        212.0390167236328,
        359.2876281738281
      ],
      "text": "available in  Web Annex B.9.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        371.65423583984375,
        179.01329040527344,
        388.0342102050781
      ],
      "text": "User perspective",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        398.28509521484375,
        527.0264892578125,
        411.43011474609375
      ],
      "text": "The GDG assessed whether concurrent testing of multiple samples would increase the diagnostic",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        413.78509521484375,
        526.9666748046875,
        426.93011474609375
      ],
      "text": "yield (i.e. the benefit to patients or the programme in terms of finding more people with TB).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        429.28509521484375,
        527.003173828125,
        442.43011474609375
      ],
      "text": "One of the PICO questions focused on the concurrent use of LC-aNAATs on respiratory and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        444.78509521484375,
        306.0316467285156,
        457.93011474609375
      ],
      "text": "stool samples for the diagnosis of TB in children.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        470.2967224121094,
        253.505859375,
        486.67669677734375
      ],
      "text": "User preferences and values",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        495.4276123046875,
        494.171875,
        508.5726318359375
      ],
      "text": "As important outcomes of the diagnostic test, people in high TB burden settings value:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        515.1795654296875,
        78.81909942626953,
        528.3245849609375
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        515.1795654296875,
        527.1292724609375,
        528.3245849609375
      ],
      "text": "getting an accurate diagnosis and reaching diagnostic closure (finally knowing “what is",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        530.6795654296875,
        171.57540893554688,
        543.8245849609375
      ],
      "text": "wrong with me”);",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        546.1795654296875,
        78.81909942626953,
        559.3245849609375
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        546.1795654296875,
        526.9630126953125,
        559.3245849609375
      ],
      "text": "avoiding diagnostic delays, as they exacerbate existing financial hardships and emotional",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        561.6795654296875,
        524.4429931640625,
        574.8245849609375
      ],
      "text": "and physical suffering and make people feel guilty for infecting others (especially children);",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.997349739074707,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        577.1796264648438,
        78.81909942626953,
        590.3246459960938
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        577.1796264648438,
        236.3772735595703,
        590.3246459960938
      ],
      "text": "having accessible facilities; and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        592.6796264648438,
        78.81909942626953,
        605.8246459960938
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        592.6796264648438,
        389.1407470703125,
        605.8246459960938
      ],
      "text": "reducing diagnosis-associated costs (e.g. travel, missing work).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        619.5181884765625,
        527.2449340820312,
        632.6632080078125
      ],
      "text": "Participants appreciate that stool collection is far less invasive than gastric lavage and can",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        635.0181884765625,
        527.1500244140625,
        648.1632080078125
      ],
      "text": "thereby reduce physical and emotional suffering of children and their parents (see  Web",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        650.5181884765625,
        136.68951416015625,
        663.6632080078125
      ],
      "text": "). Annex B.10",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        676.02978515625,
        112.7667007446289,
        692.4097900390625
      ],
      "text": "Equity",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        702.6607055664062,
        526.9918823242188,
        715.8057250976562
      ],
      "text": "Concurrent specimen testing was not practiced in the interview study countries. However, it",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        718.1607055664062,
        500.8010559082031,
        731.3057250976562
      ],
      "text": "was believed to improve access to care by minimizing repeat visits and loss to follow-up.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        742.1647338867188,
        527.182861328125,
        755.3097534179688
      ],
      "text": "According to the interview study respondents, using non-sputum specimens has the potential",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.996599197387695,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        757.6647338867188,
        527.124267578125,
        770.8097534179688
      ],
      "text": "to improve access to care, especially with a test that can be performed at all levels of the health",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.98293685913086,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        353.2680969238281,
        802.0169067382812,
        554.5132446289062,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "2. Recommendations for diagnosis of TB disease 63",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
